<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs up $2.50-2.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs up $2.50-2.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $2.50 to $2.75 higher. Trading was active. Top $51.25 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   50.50-51.25</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   50.00-50.75</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   49.00-50.25</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs   48.50-49.25</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs   47.00-48.75</p>
<p>    Sows - up $1.00-4.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-400 lbs    43.50-44.00</p>
<p>		  400-500 lbs    45.00-47.00</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    49.00-51.00</p>
</text>
